    "result": "## Summary\n\nFixed all failing tests in the frai-core test suite. The issues were:\n\n1. **Governance test failure** (`src/finetune/governance.test.js`): `APPROVAL_STATUSES` wasn't exported as a named export. Fixed by adding it as a named export in `src/finetune/index.js`.\n\n2. **Evaluation test failure** (`src/eval/index.test.js`): The `toxicityMetric` function was receiving references as the second parameter and treating them as banned terms, causing false positives. Fixed by wrapping it in the `DEFAULT_METRICS` array to only receive outputs.\n\n**All 28 tests now pass** across all 8 test files, and all existing public exports remain intact.",
